The diff changes the explicit int pattern in `int_core.ts`: `[-+]?0o[0-7]+` becomes `[-+]0o[0-7]+`, so an explicit `!!int` tag on an unsigned octal like `0o7` no longer matches, even though implicit resolution still accepts it.

